   "n": 2,
   "text": "$$\\left(\\frac{dx}{dt}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{dy}{dt}\\right)^{2}=4 \\left\\{2+2(\\sin t \\sin 2 t-\\cos t \\cos 2 t)\\right\\}=8(1-\\cos 3 t)=16 \\sin^{2}\\frac{3 t}{2}$$",
   "uses": [
