  {
   "n": 4,
   "text": "$$L=\\int_{0}^{2 \\pi}4 \\left|\\sin \\frac{3 t}{2}\\right|dt=\\frac{8}{3}\\int_{0}^{3 \\pi}\\left|\\sin u \\right|du=\\frac{8}{3}\\times 6=16$$",
   "uses": [
